'''Selangor Red Giants (SRG)''' is an esports division of [[wikipedia:Selangor F.C.|Selangor Football Club]], a professional football club founded in 1936 based in Selangor, Malaysia.

The team was also known as '''Yoodo Red Giants''' since 2023 until the Yoodo brand was discontinued in August 2024 due to the CelcomDigi merger.<ref name="yoodo discontinued">{{Cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C8L8WO4yJez/ |title=Here’s the latest update on Yoodo Brand and Services. |publisher='''Yoodo''' |date=2024-06-19}}</ref>

On March 17, 2025 '''Selangor Red Giants Esports''' and '''OG Esports''' announce strategic global partnership and will be known as '''Selangor Red Giants OG Esports'''.<ref name="srg.og"/>

On January 6, 2026, '''OG Esports''' announced that their partnership with '''Selangor Red Giants Esports''' has come to an end.<ref name="og end">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/OGesports/status/2008448449616998804|title=It was a wonderful year full of triumphs, including a historic four-peat, but all good things must come to an end, as our partnership with SRG concludes.|publisher='''OG Esports'''|date=2026-01-06}}</ref>

