'''RRQ Hoshi''' (abbreviated to '''RRQ''') formerly known as '''PSG.RRQ and RRQ.O2''' is a professional esports organization based in [[:Category:Indonesia|Indonesia]].

''"Rex Regum"'' is Latin for ''"King of Kings"'' and ''"Hoshi"'' is Japanese for ''"Star"''.

==History==
===Timeline===
{{TimelineSquadAuto
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2017-09-14|displaydate=September 14th|text='''Rex Regum Qeon''' enters the MLBB competitive scene with signing the rosters of Oxygen: {{player|Lemon|pos=flex}},{{player|TUTURU|pos=gold}}, {{player|Marsha|pos=roam}}, {{player|InstincT|pos=exp}}, {{player|xBarierJr|pos=roam}} and {{player|Banshee|pos=gold}}. Team know known as '''RRQ.O2'''. <ref name="rrq o2">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/Team.RRQ/photos/a.658178777568411/1655545051165107|title=RRQ.O2|date=2017-09-14}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2019-02-08|displaydate=February 8th|text=The organization entered a partnership with [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paris_Saint-Germain_F.C. Paris Saint-Germain], rebranded to '''PSG.RRQ'''.<ref name="psg rrq">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=463436207525466|title=PSG.RRQ|date=2019-02-08}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2019-07-08|displaydate=July 8th|text=[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paris_Saint-Germain_F.C. Paris Saint-Germain] ended partnership. The team would continue under the name '''RRQ Hoshi''' <ref name="psg end">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/Bzpb_2_FVoE/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link|title=PSG RRQ End|date=2019-07-08}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2023-01-25|displaydate=January 25th|text={{player|Renbo|pos=flex}} joins. Team renamed to the organization name '''"Rex Regum Qeon"''' <ref name="rrq 2023">{{cite web|url=https://youtu.be/Jmg4SEHwqUc|title=RRQ 2023|date=2023-01-25}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2024-01-11|displaydate=January 11th|text={{player|Octa|pos=mid}}, {{player|Bunnyqt|pos=gold}} and {{player|Vren|pos=coach}} joins. Team renamed back to '''RRQ Hoshi''' <ref name="rrq 2024">{{cite web|url=https://youtu.be/nDoH68sZBYE|title=RRQ Hoshi 2024|date=2024-01-11}}</ref>}}
}}

